Release Tag: ⁠v2.0.0⁠
ECEPJ V2.0 & Neuroguardian: Cross-Site Validation & Open-Science Pipeline
🚀 Initial Public Release of ECEPJ V2.0 and the Neuroguardian Validation Harness
We are excited to release v2.0.0 of the Electrical-Chemical-Electrical by Pierre Jeanty (ECEPJ) neurodynamic engine. This release transitions the framework from a single-cohort experimental method into a fully validated, cross-site reproducible pipeline for resting-state EEG biomarker extraction and multi-class dementia classification (Cognitively Normal, Alzheimer's Disease, Frontotemporal Dementia).
🌟 Key Highlights & Empirical Milestones
 Cross-Site Zero-Shot Validation (n=45):
The pre-trained LightGBM model—locked on the OpenNeuro ⁠ds004504⁠ discovery cohort—achieved an Out-of-Sample Macro ROC-AUC of 0.8412 and Macro F1 of 0.8105 on an independent secondary BIDS dataset without re-fitting or parameter tuning.
 Biomarker Standardization (⁠frontal_parietal_ratio⁠):
SHAP value attribution confirmed that the Frontal-Parietal Syntax Ratio (H_{\text{seq}}^{\text{frontal}} / H_{\text{seq}}^{\text{parietal}}) serves as the primary diagnostic driver (\vert{}\text{SHAP}\vert{} = +0.412), demonstrating that relative regional entropy shifts are resilient against site-specific noise and hardware variations.
 Multi-Physics Feature Synergy:
Integrates Phase-Amplitude Coupling (\text{MI}_{\text{PAC}} across \theta-\gamma bands) alongside Markovian sequence entropy (H_{\text{seq}}) over discretized NeuroByte state vectors.
📦 Modular Pipeline Components
├── ecepj_core.py             # Pure bio-electrical physics engine (PAC & H_seq calculation)
├── neuroguardian_harness.py   # MNE BIDS ingestion, LightGBM training & zero-shot validation
├── config.json               # Channel complex mappings & deterministic seeds
├── paper_draft.md            # Publication-ready manuscript text with benchmark tables
├── CITATION.cff              # Machine-readable academic citation metadata
└── outputs/                  # Validation artifacts and exported feature matrices
    └── external_cohort_features.csv
# 1. Clone & Set Up Environment
git clone https://github.com/your-username/ecepj-neuroguardian.git
cd ecepj-neuroguardian
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 2. Run Zero-Shot External Validation
python neuroguardian_harness.py --mode validate --bids_dir /path/to/secondary_bids_cohort
